# CODEOWNERS -- review ownership.
#
# PURPOSE
#   Route review to the people who own each subsystem, and guarantee that the load-bearing parts of
#   the architecture cannot be changed without an owner looking at it.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles before the first public release.

# Default
*                                   @OWNER

# Architecture -- the source of truth. A change here changes every later phase.
/docs/                              @OWNER
/ARCHITECTURE.md                    @OWNER

# The dependency rule. If this file weakens, the architecture is decorative.
/.importlinter                      @OWNER

# The plugin contract. A breaking change here breaks every third-party pack (ADR-015).
/src/ragstrike/plugins/base/        @OWNER
/src/ragstrike/core/contracts/      @OWNER

# The scoring model. Changing a weight changes every historical comparison.
/src/ragstrike/core/scoring/        @OWNER
/configs/scoring/                   @OWNER

# Safety controls -- authorization gate, rate limiter, host allowlist.
/SECURITY.md                        @OWNER
